\title{How the Formalization of Mathematics Relates to my Work}
\author{dhsorens}
\date{2025-09-02}
\meta{toc}{true}

\p{
    Most of my [work](dhsorens-rsrch) has been in [smart contract specification and verification](dhsorens-000W),
often in the context of [proof assistants](dhsorens-000B).
Proof assistants are also the tool used in the [formalization of mathematics](dhsorens-000Z).
This has prompted some thinking on the subject.
}

